OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder charge after man
OL,4,Aattacked in home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fmurder after an 81-year-old man was
OL,8,Fattacked and left with serious injuries
OL,9,Fin Doncaster.
OL,11,FJacqueline Massie is accused of assault
OL,12,Fat a property on St John's Road in
OL,13,FEdlington at about 11:40 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday, as well as theft from a
OL,15,Fdwelling and possession of an offensive
OL,16,Fweapon in a public place.
OL,18,FThe victim remains in hospital, South
OL,19,FYorkshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
