OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder charge after man
OL,4,Aattacked in home
OL,5,
OL,6,FMassie, 53, of Church Road, Edlington,
OL,7,Fappeared before Barnsley magistrates on
OL,8,FThursday and was remanded to appear at
OL,9,FSheffield Crown Court on Monday.
